  "details": "Provided sample controller for sitting layer in avatar SDK contains state behavior \"VRC Animation Tracking Control\" in the default state \"VersionSwitch\" that sets most avatar tracking to Animation. Avatar with the controller will get stuck in stand still animation after sitting in a station and then standing up.\n\nEasy solution for this is deleting the state behavior from the default state \"VersionSwitch\".\n\nPaths to affected assets:\n\nPackages/com.vrchat.avatars/Samples/AV3 Demo Assets/Animation/Controllers/vrc_AvatarV3SittingLayer.controller\n\nPackages/com.vrchat.avatars/Samples/AV3 Demo Assets/Animation/Controllers/vrc_AvatarV3SittingLayer2.controller",
